%% C4 Level 1 — System context (C4 notation, Mermaid flowchart layout)
flowchart TB
    visitor["<b>Visitor</b><br/><i>[Person]</i><br/><br/>Someone in Cambodia deciding what<br/>to order and where, within a budget"]:::person
